rd with the same mana value as this card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. Transmute only as a sorcery.)", 'Return up to three target land cards from your graveyard to your hand.\nDredge 3 (If you would draw a card, you may mill three cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Ribbons of Night deals 4 damage to target creature and you gain 4 life. If {U} was spent to cast this spell, draw a card.', "Sabertooth Alley Cat attacks each combat if able.\n{1}{R}: Creatures without defender can't block Sabertooth Alley Cat this turn.", 'Sacrifice Shambling Shell: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nDredge 3 (If you would draw a card, you may mill three cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Sacrifice a Forest: You gain 3 life.', "Scion of the Wild's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Search your library for a Plains, Island, Swamp, or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to three Aura cards with different names, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to three creature cards, reveal them, then shuffle and put those cards on top in any order.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\nSacrifice Sewerdreg: Exile target card from a graveyard.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Tap target artifact or creature.', 'Tap four untapped creatures you control: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Tap three untapped creatures you control: Tap target creature.', 'Target creature becomes the color or colors of your choice until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\nTarget creature gets