ly as a sorcery.)', 'When Sadistic Augermage dies, each player puts a card from their hand on top of their library.', 'When Sell-Sword Brute dies, it deals 2 damage to you.', 'When Sparkmage Apprentice enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', "When Spawnbroker enters the battlefield, you may exchange control of target creature you control and target creature with power less than or equal to that creature's power an opponent controls.", "When Vedalken Dismisser enters the battlefield, put target creature on top of its owner's library.", "When Vindictive Mob enters the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.\nVindictive Mob can't be blocked by Saprolings.", "When Zephyr Spirit blocks, return it to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever Agrus Kos, Wojek Veteran attacks, attacking red creatures get +2/+0 and attacking white creatures get +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Coalhauler Swine is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to each player.', 'Whenever Dimir Cutpurse deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card and you draw a card.', 'Whenever Dromad Purebred is dealt damage, you gain 1 life.', "Whenever Frenzied Goblin attacks, you may pay {R}. If you do, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever Sunhome Enforcer deals combat damage, you gain that much life.\n{1}{R}: Sunhome Enforcer gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature token leaves the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Twilight Drover.\n{2}{W}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Twilight Drover: Create two 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', "Whenever a nonartifact permanent enters the battlefield under your control, you may return another permanent you control that shares a permanent type with it to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Whenever a player casts a creature spell, each player returns all cards with the same name as that spell from their graveyard to the battlefield.',